  "description": "OpenAI-compatible provider for OutWit hosts: any Chat Completions service, OpenAI's own and the servers people run themselves (Ollama, LM Studio, vLLM, llama.cpp). Structured answers by JSON schema, bounded retries of throttled and overloaded requests (Retry-After honoured), an optional key, and failures that carry no vendor text and no key. Plain HTTP, no vendor SDK. A plugin (IIntelligenceProviderPlugin) that registers its IIntelligenceProviderFactory under the key \"openai\".",
